{"3721020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Galactic Bounty","steam_appid":3721020,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4755540],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Take the Contract. Get Paid.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>droid bounty hunter for hire<\/strong>. Accept contracts, deploy into dangerous locations, eliminate targets, break into secure systems, and get paid. Spend your rewards on <strong>weapons, hacking tools, and upgrades for your droid<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Accept the Job<\/u><\/strong><br>  Browse the contract roster and deploy with a <strong>clear objective<\/strong>:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bounty:<\/strong> Track and eliminate a high-value target.<\/li><li><strong>Extraction:<\/strong> Infiltrate secured areas and extract the target alive.<\/li><li><strong>Destruction:<\/strong> Plant explosives in enemy strongholds and escape before detonation.<\/li><li><strong>Data Breach:<\/strong> Hack terminals, bypass security, and steal intel for your client.<\/li><li><strong>Repossession:<\/strong> Infiltrate the site, take the asset, and deliver it to the buyer.<\/li><li><strong>Protection:<\/strong> Defend the asset under enemy pressure.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Blast, Breach, Hack, and Fight<\/u><\/strong><br>  Fight through local security with <strong>black-market firearms, grenades, and droid abilities<\/strong>. Get in, complete the objective, and return to your ship to collect your reward.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Get Paid. Upgrade Your Droid.<\/strong><\/u><br>  Cash in completed contracts for <i>Crypts<\/i>, <i>Data<\/i>, and <i>Reputation<\/i>. Spend your earnings at the <i>Crypt Market<\/i> to unlock restricted firearms, gear, and upgrades. Spend <i>Data<\/i> on <i>Software Upgrades<\/i> to improve your droid's combat and utility systems.<br>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Failure Has a Cost<\/strong><\/u><br>  A bad job has consequences. Losing a droid costs you one of your reserve units, and running out of reserves means Game Over. Abort the mission and take the hit, or push deeper for the payout.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Take the Contract. Get Paid.<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>droid bounty hunter for hire<\/strong>. Accept contracts, deploy into dangerous locations, eliminate targets, break into secure systems, and get paid. Spend your rewards on <strong>weapons, hacking tools, and upgrades for your droid<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Accept the Job<\/u><\/strong><br>  Browse the contract roster and deploy with a <strong>clear objective<\/strong>:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bounty:<\/strong> Track and eliminate a high-value target.<\/li><li><strong>Extraction:<\/strong> Infiltrate secured areas and extract the target alive.<\/li><li><strong>Destruction:<\/strong> Plant explosives in enemy strongholds and escape before detonation.<\/li><li><strong>Data Breach:<\/strong> Hack terminals, bypass security, and steal intel for your client.<\/li><li><strong>Repossession:<\/strong> Infiltrate the site, take the asset, and deliver it to the buyer.<\/li><li><strong>Protection:<\/strong> Defend the asset under enemy pressure.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Blast, Breach, Hack, and Fight<\/u><\/strong><br>  Fight through local security with <strong>black-market firearms, grenades, and droid abilities<\/strong>. Get in, complete the objective, and return to your ship to collect your reward.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Get Paid. Upgrade Your Droid.<\/strong><\/u><br>  Cash in completed contracts for <i>Crypts<\/i>, <i>Data<\/i>, and <i>Reputation<\/i>. Spend your earnings at the <i>Crypt Market<\/i> to unlock restricted firearms, gear, and upgrades. Spend <i>Data<\/i> on <i>Software Upgrades<\/i> to improve your droid's combat and utility systems.<br>  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Failure Has a Cost<\/strong><\/u><br>  A bad job has consequences. Losing a droid costs you one of your reserve units, and running out of reserves means Game Over. Abort the mission and take the hit, or push deeper for the payout.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.poster.avif?t=1793642889\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.webm?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/extras\/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.mp4?t=1793642889\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Play as a droid bounty hunter for hire. Accept contracts, deploy into dangerous locations, eliminate targets, break into secure systems, and get paid. Spend your rewards on weapons, gear and software upgrades for your droid.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/903e5e5402c51b3d386a0289aca2a024118690ae\/header.jpg?t=1793642889","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/176664e8cb66060aa614bc62e5be69cb6a01fcfc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642889","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/176664e8cb66060aa614bc62e5be69cb6a01fcfc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642889","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-7400 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-9700 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 Deadscripts Interactive. Galactic Bounty™ and all associated assets are trademarks of Deadscripts Interactive. All rights reserved.","developers":["Deadscripts Interactive"],"publishers":["Deadscripts Interactive"],"demos":[{"appid":4755540,"description":""},{"appid":4755540,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":449,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$4.49"},"packages":[1309871],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Galactic Bounty","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1309871,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Galactic Bounty - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $4.49","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":449}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/fadf02b5bb2b02f62359e4b5cb25a885b7f56420\/ss_fadf02b5bb2b02f62359e4b5cb25a885b7f56420.600x338.jpg?t=1793642889","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3721020\/fadf02b5bb2b02f62359e4b5cb25a885b7f56420\/ss_fadf02b5bb2b02f62359e4b5cb25a885b7f56420.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642889"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3